01:01:04.880 --> 01:01:07.400
one of the criteria it will
satisfy

01:01:07.400 --> 01:01:09.200
is that when you draw it,

01:01:09.200 --> 01:01:13.180
the sum of the positive errors

01:01:13.180 --> 01:01:16.020
will equal exactly the sum of
the negative errors, Because

01:01:16.020 --> 01:01:19.760
those together will have to add
to zero.

01:01:19.760 --> 01:01:24.200
And this is like a reoccurring
idea, one that we will see

01:01:24.200 --> 01:01:27.360
