01:01:37.040 --> 01:01:37.980
us.

01:01:37.980 --> 01:01:41.720
Just an important thing to know.

01:01:41.720 --> 01:01:43.220
English interpretation.

01:01:50.620 --> 01:01:55.520
Errors must sum to zero.

